<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria Industrial Gases full yr profit up.</title>
<headline>Nigeria Industrial Gases full yr profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result for Industrial Gases Plc to end-September 1996. (In million naira unless stated).</p>
<p>				    1996	1995</p>
<p>     Turnover		    394     305.4</p>
<p>     Profit after taxation   104	81.9</p>
<p>     Taxation		   22.9	30.3</p>
<p>     Profit after taxation  81.1	51.6</p>
<p>NOTE: A bonus issue of one new share for every share held and a dividend of 60 kobo per share have been proposed. ($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
